# What to park and migrate from /mnt/data-2tb/orderready (rsync filter rules,
# first match wins). Build output is rebuildable, except the mutation receipts
# and run records under target/or/artifacts that evidence files cite by path.
+ /wt/*/target/
+ /wt/*/target/or/
+ /wt/*/target/or/artifacts/***
- /wt/*/target/**
- target/
- node_modules/
- .venv/
- frontend/dist/
